<h1>{html.escape(cfg['index_title'])}</h1><p class="intro">{html.escape(cfg['index_intro'])}</p>
<p class="small"><span class="num">{len(cards)}</span> articles. Index régénéré le <span class="num">{today()}</span>.</p>
<section class="grid">{''.join(cards)}</section>
<footer>Index construit par <code>Scripts/Articles/BuildArticles.py</code> depuis <code>Scripts/Articles/articles.json</code>.</footer>
